      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "A Sith Warrior stands here, his watchful and disapproving gaze upon the training chamber. Occasionally, he may avail himself of joining in the practice, but he prefers to do so without the prying eyes of others about him.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00008",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00004",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00002",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00001",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00000",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00001": {
      "Id": "entry-00001",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "\"Our glorious, deceased leader. His philosophy gathered us, did it not? Rallied us, beneath his shadows. I admire him; he was a great warleader, a master general, and he would have won us the war if not for Malak's betrayal.\"",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": []
    },
    "entry-00002": {
      "Id": "entry-00002",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "There is a smile, though it is neither gentle nor humorless; instead, it is eager, a feral gleam in his eyes. \"Powerful. They are greater tyrants than any that had yet graced our galaxy. Nevertheless, the Force shall serve us, and we shall unseat them, or die in the trying.\"",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00003",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00003": {
      "Id": "entry-00003",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "The recitation was uttered grimly, and included an assessing look. He did not seem to hesitate much in sharing them. \"There are seven. The first is the foundation, that which is called Shii-Cho. The second is Makashi, which is a duelist's favorite. The third is Soresu, to guard against the banal tools of blasters that lesser mortals are wont to employ. The forth is Ataru, a form favored by those who are nimble and graceful, though I find it a touch distasteful. The fifth composes of two related disciplines: Shien and Djem So, the former to guard and the latter to destroy. The sixth is that of Niman, favored by sorcerers. Finally, there is Juyo, paramount amongst we of the Sith.\"",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00006",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00005",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00004": {
      "Id": "entry-00004",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "\"No. Find another teacher. I shall not take one who has not earned my favor.\"",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00007",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00005": {
      "Id": "entry-00005",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "\"An instrument of murder. The Jedi would wax poetry about how it is a sophisticated tool, that it is a weapon of peacekeepers. They are wrong. It is an instrument designed for one thing and one alone; to cut. Once you understand that, you shall understand what it means to be Sith, and be purer than the path which the Jedi in their ignorance deny.\"",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00009",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    }
  },
